10 </div></td></tr><tr><td style="width: 336pt; padding-top: 1.33pt; text-align: left; vertical-align: bottom;"><div class="BRDSX_fpara" style="color: #000000; font-family: 'Times New Roman', Times, serif; font-size: 8pt; margin-top: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-align: left;">John Johnston</div></td><td style="width: 11.39pt;"><div style="font-size: 1pt;">&#8194;</div></td><td style="width: 11.39pt;"><div style="font-size: 1pt;">&#8194;</div></td><td style="width: 27.12pt; padding-top: 1.33pt; text-align: center; vertical-align: bottom; white-space: nowrap;"><div class="BRDSX_fpara" style="color: #000000; font-family: 'Times New Roman', Times, serif; font-size: 8pt; margin-top: 0pt; margin-left: 0.56pt; text-align: left;">222,708</div></td><td style="width: 11.39pt;"><div style="font-size: 1pt;">&#8194;</div></td><td style="width: 11.39pt;"><div style="font-size: 1pt;">&#8194;</div></td><td style="width: 39.32pt; padding-top: 1.33pt; text-align: center; vertical-align: bottom; white-space: nowrap;"><div class="BRDSX_fpara" style="color: #000000; font-family: 'Times New Roman', Times, serif; font-size: 8pt; margin-top: 0pt; margin-left: 8.66pt; text-align: left;">29,210</div></td></tr><tr class="BRDSX_boxspacer"><td style="height: 3.25pt; width: 336pt;"><div style="font-size: 1pt;">&#8194;</div></td><td style="height: 3.25pt; width: 11.39pt;"><div style="font-size: 1pt;">&#8194;</div></td><td style="height: 3.25pt; width: 11.39pt;"><div style="font-size: 1pt;">&#8194;</div></td><td style="height: 3.25pt; width: 27.12pt;"><div style="font-size: 1pt;">&#8194;</div></td><td style="height: 3.25pt; width: 11.39pt;"><div style="font-size: 1pt;">&#8194;</div></td><td style="height: 3.25pt; width: 11.39pt;"><div style="font-size: 1pt;">&#8194;</div></td><td style="height: 3.25pt; width: 39.32pt;"><div style="font-size: 1pt;">&#8194;</div></td></tr></table></div></div><div class="BRDSX_block-frill" style="width: 468pt; margin-top: 12pt; margin-left: 0pt;"><div class="BRDSX_unk